cts consistency between the desktop application and the Excel report.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"grep_search","args":{"MatchPerLine":"true","Query":"\"get_process\"","SearchPath":"\"D:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\\\\desktop_app\"","toolAction":"\"Searching code\"","toolSummary":"\"Search get_process in desktop_app\""}}]}
